istic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/transition(_:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/transition(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/transition(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"transition"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI13AnyTransitionV","text":"AnyTransition"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}],"role":"symbol","title":"transition(_:)","kind":"symbol"}}}